================================================================================
NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3
================================================================================

Author: NVIDIA Corporation
Model: Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3
Link: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: none in this repository. PushToType does not modify the weights.

The Parakeet engine downloads the int8 ONNX build
istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx (CC-BY-4.0), which is a format conversion
of the NVIDIA model. Revision 8f23f0c03c8761650bdb5b40aaf3e40d2c15f1ce.

The English Parakeet option is istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-onnx, a format
conversion of NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2), also CC-BY-4.0.
Revision 0bbb45a3365852604aef28b538a8f066f4ccaa85.
Changes: none in this repository.

