================================================================================
Other runtimes
================================================================================

onnx-asr loads the Parakeet ONNX files. mlx and mlx-audio run Bark.
uv (Apache-2.0) installs the Phonon Python environment.
Those packages keep their own licenses inside the environment the setup
scripts create on your Mac. They are not vendored as source in this repo.
